{
    "name": {
        "ara": "قُلْ لِلَّذِي لَامَنِي",
        "en": "Qul li-lladhī Lāmanī - Say to the One Who Blamed Me"
    },
    "verses": {
        "ara": [
            "لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ",
            "لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ",
            "لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ",
            "مُحَمَّدٌ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ",

            "قُلْ لِلَّذِي لَامَنِي",
            "فِيهَا وَعَنَّفَنِي",
            "حَيْثُ لَمْ يَعْرِفْ شَأْنِي",
            "لِذَاكَ هُوَ الْمَعْذُورُ",

            "لَوْ عَرَفَ عُذَّالِي",
            "حَقِيقَةَ الْوِصَالِ",
            "لَصَارُوا مِثْلَ حَالِي",
            "وَلَكِنْ جَرَى الْمَقْدُورُ",

            "جَلَسْنَا عَلَى حَضْرَةٍ",
            "مَعَ مُلُوكِ الْخَمْرَةِ",
            "مِنْ عَجَائِبِ الْقُدْرَةِ",
            "كَأْسُهَا عَنْهَا يَدُورُ",

            "هَذِي لَيْلَى قَدْ بَدَتْ",
            "بِالْحُسْنِ تَلَوَّنَتْ",
            "لِبَعْضِهَا ظَهَرَتْ",
            "وَبَطَنَتْ فِي الظُّهُورِ",

            "سَقَتْنِي كَأْسَ التَّحْقِيقِ",
            "وَهَدَتْنِي لِلطَّرِيقِ",
            "أَغْرَقَتْنِي فِي الْعَمِيقِ",
            "بَحْرُهَا فَاقَ الْبُحُورَ",

            "فَوَاللَّهِ مَنْ دَنَا",
            "وَذَاقَ سِرَّ الْفَنَا",
            "لَبَاحَ بِمَا بُحْنَا",
            "قَهْرًا وَهُوَ الْمَعْذُورُ"
        ],
        "en": [
            "lā ilāha illā Llāhu",
            "lā ilāha illā Llāhu",
            "lā ilāha illā Llāhu",
            "Muḥammadun rasūlu Llāhi",

            "qul li-lladhī lāmanī",
            "fīhā wa-ʿannafanī",
            "ḥaythu lam yaʿrif shaʾnī",
            "li-dhāka huwa l-maʿdhūru",

            "law ʿarafa ʿudhdhālī",
            "ḥaqīqata l-wiṣāli",
            "la-ṣārū mithla ḥālī",
            "wa-lākin jarā l-maqdūru",

            "jalasnā ʿalā ḥaḍratin",
            "maʿa mulūki l-khamrati",
            "min ʿajāʾibi l-qudrati",
            "kaʾsuhā ʿanhā yadūru",

            "hādhī Laylā qad badat",
            "bi-l-ḥusni talawwanat",
            "li-baʿḍihā ẓaharat",
            "wa-baṭanat fī ẓ-ẓuhūri",

            "saqatnī kaʾsa t-taḥqīqi",
            "wa-hadatnī li-ṭ-ṭarīqi",
            "aghraqatnī fī l-ʿamīqi",
            "baḥruhā fāqa l-buḥūra",

            "fa-wa-Llāhi man danā",
            "wa-dhāqa sirra l-fanā",
            "la-bāḥa bi-mā buḥnā",
            "qahran wa-huwa l-maʿdhūru"
        ]
    },
    "translation": {
        "en": [
            "There is no god but Allah",
            "There is no god but Allah",
            "There is no god but Allah",
            "Muhammad is the Messenger of Allah",

            "Say to the one who blamed me",
            "for this love and reproached me,",
            "He knew not my state",
            "and thus he is excused.",

            "If my critics had known",
            "the truth of this union,",
            "They would have become as I am",
            "but fate has decreed its course.",

            "We sat in the Presence",
            "among the kings of wine,",
            "A marvel of divine power",
            "its cup passes from her hand.",

            "Here is Layla, revealed",
            "adorned in beauty’s hues,",
            "Half unveiled to the sight",
            "and half concealed within the appearing.",

            "She gave me the cup of realization",
            "and guided me to the Path,",
            "She drowned me in the deep",
            "her ocean surpasses all seas.",

            "By God! Whoever draws near",
            "and tastes the secret of annihilation,",
            "Will utter what we have uttered",
            "by compulsion — and he is excused."
        ]
    },
